	<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" > <b></b></font>
	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" >What's important about reputation?  Lots of things.<br />
<br />
Do you remember what you wrote?  It wasn't that long ago, Grimmy.<br />
<br />
<a href="http://pub22.ezboard.com/frutabagaparadoxforumfrm11.showMessage?topicID=5.topic" target="_blank">http://pub22.ezboard.com/frutabagap...topicID=5.topic</a><br />
<br />
